# Compiled binaries at the repo root. `go build ./cmd/<name>` drops its output
# here, and these have been committed by accident before: the 10MB `purebuild`
# binary landed in d860815 (#172) and had to be removed again in b0f18a1
# ("chore: drop stray purebuild binary from the tree"). Nothing stopped it
# recurring, because the tree was cleaned but no ignore rule was added — and
# the blob is still in every clone's history regardless.
/purebuild
/tacklebox
/tbwasm
